(text "J2 display ASSUMED photo order: GND,VCC,SCL,SDA,RES,DC,CS,BLK; verify delivered board before footprint.\nJ3 SD photo order: 3V3,CS,MOSI,CLK,MISO,GND. Both modules use 3.3 V logic. No 5 V SD reader.\nSeparate pulled-up chip selects. Initialize SD in SPI mode with display deselected; serialize all bus transactions.\nBacklight is powered through Q3, never directly from GPIO. BL_SUPPLY-to-BLK 100R limiter is a conservative bring-up value.\nCheck BLK topology/current before changing limiter. SD internal DAT pull-ups must be checked; unused pads not exposed." (at 12.7 12.7 0) (effects(font(size 1.05 1.05))(justify left top)) (uuid "c3f9a4d0-93f2-48d0-ae84-12bedbb8ce52")))
